  "source_reasoning": [
    "OnRead pi denotes the current undecoded body; it advances by two after each header and by packetLen after dispatch.",
    "Read(ri-pi) compacts the current remaining body to offset zero; the next OnRead initializes pi=0 while mode remains SM_READ_BODY. A constant offset2 decrypts incorrect bytes there.",
    "For coalesced complete messages, pi points past earlier messages. inBuf+pi selects that body; inBuf+2 selects the first body repeatedly.",
    "The stage admits only exact original tree/files, applies one byte-sequence replacement, writes new external directory, leaves shipping upstream and policies unchanged."
  ],
